  "Strat_Rule1" [label="(0,0,0) If iridate exchange interactions allow heterointerfacing different types of magnetism and such heterointerfacing may induce magnetic frustration, then a heterostructure-based strategy can frustrate Neel antiferromagnetic order in square-lattice iridates."];
